    "text": "By Steve Levine ,\n9 hours ago COLUMBUS, Ohio (WSYX) — Columbus police are releasing few details about what led up to an exchange of gunfire Wednesday morning at a southwest apartment complex. Jordan Stewart said the violence unfolded at Hartford Village Commons after he noticed two people pointing a flashlight into his SUV shortly before 5 a.m. on Cinna Drive. Read full article\n2",
